> ME_{s,c}^{\mathrm{opt}} &= \frac{L_{s,c}^{\mathrm{opt}}}{C'_{s,c}}
> = \frac{B_{s,c}^{\mathrm{opt}} / \sum_i P^{c}_i}{C'_{s,c}}.
> \end{aligned}
> \]
